# Topic ACL (definition §23.6: 发布测试账号需 Publish 权限，订阅账号需 Subscribe 权限)
# publisher account: may publish device telemetry
user sim-iot-pub
topic write pushToFactory/#
topic read $SYS/#

# subscriber account for the platform / testers: read-only on device telemetry
user sim-iot-sub
topic read pushToFactory/#
topic read $SYS/#
